      "description": "This towering predator has an enormous head and a mouth full of dagger-sized teeth. It stands on two powerful legs and has only vestigial forelimbs. A rare species of dinosaur that is thought extinct, but due to its size and sheer ferocity has fended off almost all other predators in its own hunt for prey. Alive since the beginning of time, its power as well as its durability causes it to have a reputation as a beast to run away from rather than to fight."
